# 基础词 Unit14
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit14核心词汇

{{cycle}}{/ˈsaɪkl/}{{n. 循环；周期；自行车}}{{The water cycle is essential to life on Earth.}}
{{daily}}{/ˈdeɪli/}}adj. 每日的；adv. 每天}}{{Reading the newspaper is part of my daily routine.}}
{{damage}}{/ˈdæmɪdʒ/}}n. 损害；v. 损害}}{{The storm caused severe damage to the buildings.}}
{{damp}}{/dæmp/}}adj. 潮湿的；n. 潮湿}}{{The basement is always damp during the rainy season.}}
{{dance}}{/dɑːns/}}v. 跳舞；n. 舞蹈}}{{They danced together at the wedding reception.}}
{{danger}}{/ˈdeɪndʒər/}}n. 危险；威胁}}{{Smoking is a danger to your health.}}
{{dare}}{/deər/}}v. 敢；胆敢}}{{She dared to challenge the traditional观点.}}
{{dark}}{/dɑːrk/}}adj. 黑暗的；深色的}}{{It gets dark very early in winter.}}
{{data}}{/ˈdeɪtə/}}n. 数据；资料}}{{The researchers collected data from over 1,000 participants.}}
{{date}}{/deɪt/}}n. 日期；约会；v. 约会}}{{What is the date of your graduation ceremony?}}
{{daughter}}{/ˈdɔːtər/}}n. 女儿}}{{Their daughter just started elementary school.}}
{{dawn}}{/dɔːn/}}n. 黎明；开端；v. 破晓}}{{The fishermen set out at dawn to catch fish.}}
{{day}}{/deɪ/}}n. 天；白天}}{{She works eight hours a day, five days a week.}}
{{dead}}{/ded/}}adj. 死的；无生命的}}{{The plant is dead because it wasn't watered.}}
{{deal}}{/diːl/}}v. 处理；交易；n. 交易}}{{The company closed a major deal with a foreign partner.}}
{{dear}}{/dɪər/}}adj. 亲爱的；昂贵的}}{{Dear friends, welcome to our annual celebration.}}
{{death}}{/deθ/}}n. 死亡；消亡}}{{The death of the famous actor shocked the world.}}
{{debate}}{/dɪˈbeɪt/}}n./v. 辩论；争论}}{{The students debated the issue of climate change.}}
{{debt}}{/det/}}n. 债务；欠债}}{{He is working hard to pay off his debts.}}
{{decade}}{/ˈdekeɪd/}}n. 十年；十年期}}{{The city has changed significantly over the past decade.}}
{{decay}}{/dɪˈkeɪt/}}v./n. 腐烂；衰退}}{{The old wooden house has begun to decay.}}
{{deceive}}{/dɪˈsiːv/}}v. 欺骗；蒙蔽}}{{He deceived his friends with a虚假的故事.}}
{{decide}}{/dɪˈsaɪd/}}v. 决定；判决}}{{She decided to pursue a career in medicine.}}
{{decision}}{/dɪˈsɪʒn/}}n. 决定；决策}}{{Making a difficult decision requires careful thought.}}
{{declare}}{/dɪˈkleər/}}v. 宣布；声明}}{{The country declared its independence in 1945.}}
{{decline}}{/dɪˈklaɪn/}}v. 下降；拒绝；n. 衰退}}{{Sales have declined by 15% this quarter.}}
{{decorate}}{/ˈdekəreɪt/}}v. 装饰；布置}}{{They decorated the room with balloons and flowers.}}
{{decrease}}{/dɪˈkriːs/}}v./n. 减少；降低}}{{The temperature decreased significantly overnight.}}
{{deed}}{/diːd/}}n. 行为；契约}}{{Good deeds always come back to reward you.}}
{{deep}}{/diːp/}}adj. 深的；深刻的}}{{The lake is very deep in the middle.}}
{{defeat}}{/dɪˈfiːt/}}v. 击败；n. 失败}}{{Our team defeated the champions in a close match.}}
{{defend}}{/dɪˈfend/}}v. 防御；辩护}}{{The lawyer defended his client in court.}}
{{define}}{/dɪˈfaɪn/}}v. 定义；限定}}{{How do you define success in life?}}
{{definite}}{/ˈdefɪnət/}}adj. 明确的；确定的}}{{We need a definite answer by tomorrow.}}
{{degree}}{/dɪˈɡriː/}}n. 程度；学位；度数}}{{She earned a master's degree in economics.}}
{{delay}}{/dɪˈleɪ/}}v./n. 耽搁；延迟}}{{The flight was delayed by two hours due to fog.}}
{{deliberate}}{/dɪˈlɪbərət/}}adj. 故意的；深思熟虑的}}{{It was a deliberate attempt to mislead the public.}}
{{delicate}}{/ˈdelɪkət/}}adj. 精致的；脆弱的；微妙的}}{{The situation requires delicate handling.}}
{{delight}}{/dɪˈlaɪt/}}n. 高兴；v. 使高兴}}{{The children squealed with delight at the surprise.}}
{{deliver}}{/dɪˈlɪvər/}}v. 递送；发表（演讲）}}{{The postman delivers mail every morning.}}
